// M5-A3P-1000. Ch17 B08 "The choice" (C, 4 min, ~220 words): the act's hinge. act3_ch17.md §2 B08.
// Night on the hull's deck, the whole party in a ring, Asha standing. RULE 3: Asha chooses the Unbinding in her OWN
// words, plainly (gentle, precise, unbending), and says the cost out loud ONCE: everything bound goes. Not a vow, not
// a speech. Each companion answers in ONE line, none of them a vow; Liss is the hardest and comes last (pillar 6: she
// builds the rig anyway). Kerrid's is "First down the stair." (ADR 0020). `the_choice` is a bed that never resolves.
// RULE 5: held light only. README rule 3: no singing of any verse here.
title: ch17_the_choice
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
@letterbox on
@camera D13
@music the_choice fade=3.0
@wait 4.0
@mark asha deck_centre walk
@wait 2.0
Asha [neutral]: I've been thinking since the Choir. I want to say it once, properly. #line:ch17_choice_001
Asha [determined]: I'm not going to sing myself in. And I'm not going home to sing nothing. #line:ch17_choice_002
@wait 2.0
Asha [neutral]: If I sing myself in, I hold it thirteen years. Then somebody's daughter does. #line:ch17_choice_003
Asha [sad]: If I go home, my mother holds it, and the High Warden spends someone else. #line:ch17_choice_004
@wait 2.5
Asha [determined]: I'm going to end it. All of it. #line:ch17_choice_005
@wait 3.0
@camera D14
Asha [grief]: Everything that's held goes. The lamps. Their engines. Ressa. Corran. Kerrid. #line:ch17_choice_006
@wait 4.0
@camera D13
Toma [neutral]: I stopped asking them to stay a while ago. I just hadn't said so. #line:ch17_choice_007
@wait 1.5
Ysolde [sad]: Corran would have said yes before you finished the sentence. #line:ch17_choice_008
@wait 1.5
Pell [sad]: Ressa too. She has waited long enough to be lifted. #line:ch17_choice_009
@wait 2.0
<<if $ch16_camp_talk>>
    Rhen [tender]: Coming up slow. I said I'd count. #line:ch17_choice_010
<<else>>
    Rhen [determined]: Then we go down and do it. #line:ch17_choice_011
<<endif>>
@wait 2.0
Kerrid [neutral]: First down the stair. #line:ch17_choice_012
@wait 4.0
@camera D15
@anim liss look_at hull_engine
@wait 3.0
Liss [cold]: The Kite flies on bound light. Everything we make does. #line:ch17_choice_013
@wait 2.0
Liss [determined]: Then I'd better build you something that gets you there. #line:ch17_choice_014
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch17_chose_the_unbinding = true>>
@fade out 2.0
@letterbox off
===
